'''Truth's Devouring Maw''' (万物誘う真理の大渦, ''Banbutsu Izanau Shinri no Ōuzu'', '''Great Whirlpool of Truth That Entices All Things''') is the 20th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 118th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty. The gimmick of this sub-chapter is that every stage has an enemy with [[Wave Attack]]s or [[Mini-Wave]]s.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter isn't too hard apart from [[Newton's Fruit]] which may give some players a bit of trouble when first playing it and the boss, [[Sage of Logic Newtone]], isn't too bad of a boss unlike the infamous [[Sage of Mind Soractes]].

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Sage of Logic Newtone]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy who's slow in both movement speed and attack rate, but deals incredibly high damage from long range with an enormous Omni Strike, slows units for 4 seconds, fires level 9 [[Mini-Wave]]s, and Strengthens by 50% at 50% HP.

This sub-chapter also includes a new obtainable unit, [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]]. He has a 30% chance to drop from the final stage (100% if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

